		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=19021#p19021"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,<br />voici un exemple de fonction appelée dans un trigger :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>CREATE FUNCTION stamp_insert() RETURNS trigger
    LANGUAGE plpgsql
    AS $$
DECLARE
nom_base varchar;
    BEGIN
        SELECT INTO nom_base current_database();
        NEW.dat_creat := current_timestamp;
        NEW.user_db_creat := nom_base;
        RETURN NEW;
    END;
$$;

ALTER FUNCTION public.stamp_insert() OWNER TO toto;</code></pre></div><p>et le trigger :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>CREATE TRIGGER stamp_insert
    BEFORE INSERT ON matable
    FOR EACH ROW
    EXECUTE PROCEDURE stamp_insert();</code></pre></div><p>Espérant vous aider</p><p>Alex</p>]]></content>
